# -----------------------------
# Assets: the loose files are the working copy; git commits one pack per
# category in asset_packs/ instead (tools/pack_assets.py, run by the
# pre-commit hook; `py -m tools.pack_assets --unpack` restores the files).
# Caches, reports, plant design inputs and the downloaded map reference
# data are not packed.
# -----------------------------
assets/

